e foreign nodes still have a yellow warning color.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/3bfa50fd329cb9a7b01b0ab1cd7ac8f27f7391ac/editor/scene/scene_tree_editor.cpp#L466-L469\n\n5. In the code above, change `SNAME(\"warning_color\")` to `SNAME(\"accent_color\")`, and recompile Godot.\n6. In Editor Settings, change the \"accent color\" from blue to another color.\n7. See that the foreign nodes now have the new non-blue color.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119672/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119672/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}